00:13:43.160 --> 00:13:45.400
ready to be deployed whenever.

00:13:45.400 --> 00:13:46.340
MARTIN: OK, very good.

00:13:46.340 --> 00:13:49.250
So it's not serving traffic yet.

00:13:49.250 --> 00:13:53.210
