00:13:58.820 --> 00:14:01.730
Then you can go deploy
it to Cloud Run.

00:14:01.730 --> 00:14:04.820
So you just write
gcloud run deploy,

00:14:04.820 --> 00:14:08.390
providing your service
name, critterwatch-rest-api,

00:14:08.390 --> 00:14:10.945
