allow-unauthenticated,

00:14:31.720 --> 00:14:34.310
and also just provide
our project again.

00:14:34.310 --> 00:14:35.900
MARTIN: OK, very good.

00:14:35.900 --> 00:14:37.460
So again, this
would probably sit

00:14:37.460 --> 00:14:40.790
at an end of a-- at the
end of a CI/CD pipeline.

00:14:40.790 --> 00:14:42.440
But we're running it
interactively here

00:14:42.440 --> 00:14:44.180
